@StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5215

### 1. Get All Students
GET {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Student by ID (ID: 1)
GET {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Add a New Student
POST {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Daniel Miller",
  "email": "daniel.miller@example.com",
  "course": "Cyber Security"
}

### 4. Update an Existing Student (ID: 1)
PUT {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Alice Johnson Updated",
  "email": "alice.updated@example.com",
  "course": "Artificial Intelligence"
}

### 5. Delete a Student (ID: 3)
DELETE {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/students/3
Accept: application/json

### 6. Test Validation Error (Invalid Email & Missing Course)
POST {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "course": ""
}

### 7. Test Not Found (ID: 9999)
GET {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/students/9999
Accept: application/json
